Literature

↓

Source Preservation

↓

Addressability (Source → Witness → Segment → Unit)

↓

Knowledge Extraction

↓

Anchored Claims (Claim + Evidence + Provenance)

↓

Governance (Proposal → Review → Approval → Canonical)

↓

Canonical Ontology

↓

